data: {"id": "2bb67681158c4ba7-thinking-parallel_evidence-2092", "run_id": "2bb67681158c4ba7", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 采集事实与冲突\n\n### 1. 状态确认\n- **当前状态**: Pending，`node: <none>`，未被调度到任何节点。\n- **初始状态**: Pending（与当前一致，未恢复）。\n\n### 2. PendingUnschedulable 根因\n- **支持证据** (describe + events):\n  - `FailedScheduling` 事件 (21m, 10m x2): `0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector.`\n  - 关键标签选择器: `Node-Selectors: aiops.lab/unavailable=true`\n  - 集群仅 3 个节点，全部不匹配该 label 选择器。\n  - Preemption 无帮助 (`3 Preemption is not helpful for scheduling`)。\n- **直接原因确认**: Pod 因 `nodeSelector: aiops.lab/unavailable", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788404740402, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

